.TH VARCO-GTK 1 "2026-11-03" "varco 1.0.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
varco-gtk \- graphical interface of the Varco firewall
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B varco-gtk
.RB [ \-\-background ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B varco-gtk
shows the connections waiting for a decision as desktop notifications with
.IR "Allow always" ,
.I "Only this time"
and
.I Block
buttons, and offers pages for activity, programs started on the computer,
active connections, rules and privacy. It runs as the desktop user; every
action is authorized by
.BR varcod (8)
through polkit. Closing the window keeps it running in the background to
deliver notifications; use
.I Quit
from the menu to stop it.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-background
Start without opening the window. Used by the autostart entry at login.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/xdg/autostart/org.k1m1k.Varco-autostart.desktop
Starts the interface in the background at login.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR varco (1),
.BR varcod (8)
